WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.370
Getting around Basecamp
is faster than ever,

2
00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.290
and you can now use
your keyboard to do it.

3
00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.410
We've added a bunch of keyboard
shortcuts. Let's jump in.

4
00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.730
I'll show you how it works.

5
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.500
So with any page open in Basecamp,

6
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.390
if you hold down the SHIFT key,

7
00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.910
you'll see these little icons popping up

8
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.100
to let you know about those shortcuts.

9
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.890
Release the SHIFT, they'll
go away, hold, SHIFT down,

10
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.360
and they'll pop back up.

11
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.980
So with that SHIFT key down,

12
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.360
I can type any of those letters.

13
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.410
Let's do T for My Tasks, and
My Tasks will pop right up.

14
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:32.190
Shift + T again to close them.
Same thing with events.

15
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.120
SHIFT + E. Those will pop
open and SHIFT E again,

16
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.620
and they will disappear.

17
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.770
These shortcuts are throughout
Basecamp, so just hold

18
00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.900
that SHIFT key and you'll
see where they are.

19
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.080
Some of the ones I use most
frequently are SHIFT + S,

20
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.000
which pops open the sidebar.

21
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.300
And from here I can use
my arrows to navigate

22
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.160
to the notification I wanna look at.

23
00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:54.951
Hit return and I'll go right to it.

24
00:00:54.951 --> 00:00:56.651
SHIFT + S will close that

25
00:00:56.651 --> 00:00:58.050
sidebar back.

26
00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.590
Another one you might want is
SHIFT+P to send a quick ping.

27
00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.210
That ping bar will open.

28
00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:05.460
It's ready for me to
type someone's name in,

29
00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.500
and then I can easily ping them all

30
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.120
without touching my mouse.

31
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.150
And last one that's gonna
be important is SHIFT+J.

32
00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.850
That gets you to that main jump menu.

33
00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.140
That's where your search bar is.

34
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.310
You have a couple buttons at the top,

35
00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.560
but you can easily jump between projects

36
00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.910
with that jump menu.

37
00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.350
That one's gonna be your best friend.

38
00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.030
All of our Basecamp shortcuts are on

39
00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:27.030
basecamp.com/keyboard, so check those out.

40
00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.940
You'll be a pro in no time. Oh, one more.

41
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.890
If you ever get stuck
on anything in Basecamp,

42
00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:35.070
hit SHIFT + ? and
our help guides will pop up.
